{{Quotation|[[Notorious Foe: Avarr the Fallen]]|
Beware! Avarr is a Norn whose battles are fought without honor, his victories as shallow and empty as the bottomless pit in Jaga Moraine where he resides, banished from Norn society, fallen from the grace of the bear spirit. The animated remains of those he has poisoned, cheated, and murdered are bound to him, following him always, his unwitting servants in death.
}}

[[Avarr the Fallen]] is a [[Norn]] [[boss]] that appears in [[Jaga Moraine]].

==Locations==
* [[Far Shiverpeaks]]
** {{NPC location|Jaga Moraine}}

==Skills==
* {{Skill icon|Animate Bone Fiend}}
* {{Skill icon|Blood of the Master}}
* {{Skill icon|Dark Bond}}
* {{Skill icon|Jagged Bones}} ([[elite]])
* {{Skill icon|Strip Enchantment}}
* {{Skill icon|Taste of Death}}
* {{Skill icon|Verata's Aura}}

==Quotes==
: ''"Rise, my minions! The living offer their flesh!"''

==Items dropped==
* [[Avarr's Scepter]] ([[unique]])

==Notes==
* He is one of the bosses to be killed for the [[quest]] [[Anything You Can Do]]. When you approach him a number of [[Bone Fiend (ranger)|Bone Fiends]] will appear. These Bone Fiends are not [[minion]]s, thus he can't use Taste of Death on them and his Dark Bond won't work either.  Also, Verata's Aura and [[Verata's Gaze]] cannot gain control of these creatures. 
* Although he is a Norn, he does not use [[Bear Form]] because he fell from the grace of the [[Bear Spirit]].
* Despite this being an 8 person area, it is possible to take the route shown, defeating very few mobs along the way, to reach and defeat this boss with a 4 person team. That can help improve the odds of receiving the unique weapon drop.

==Trivia==
*It is possible to see off the edge of the instanced map of Jaga Moraine from where Avarr spawns.
